# Algodue UPM209.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Algodue UPM209 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: algodue-upm209-users-manual.pdf (Modbus Communication Protocol chapter)
# | - Single/3-phase power quality meter, panel mount.
# | - FC03 or FC04 (Read Holding/Input Registers).
# | - IEEE float bank at 0x1000H (4096 decimal): f32 IEEE 754, SI units directly.
# | - Integer bank at 0x0000H uses milli-units (not used in this TOML).
# | - Demand values at 0x110EH (4366 decimal): f32, SI units.
# | - Energy counters at 0x1400H (5120 decimal): f32, kWh.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, 9600 baud, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Algodue
@model=UPM209
@description=Single/3-phase power quality meter — V/I/P/Q/S/PF/DPF/THD/frequency/energy/demands (f32 IEEE, FC03/04, 0x1000 float bank, SI units). Demands at 0x110E, energy (kWh) at 0x1400.
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/algodue-upm209.toml; Source: algodue-upm209-users-manual.pdf (Modbus Communication Protocol chapter). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
